This file documents changes done for the stan-math project

- Added an `abs_tol` parameter to
  `boost/math/quadrature/gauss_kronrod.hpp`'s public
  `gauss_kronrod<Real, N>::integrate()`, and forwarded it to the five
  `recursive_adaptive_integrate()` entry points in place of the hard-coded
  `Real(0)`.

  Used by `stan/math/prim/functor/integrate_1d_gauss_kronrod.hpp`.
